(1) Services implemented to fulfill the rights of women victims are carried out with the following principles: a. respect for human rights;

b. non-discrimination;

c. confidentiality;

d. empathy;

e. inclusion;

f. empowerment;

g. victim-based decisions;

h. honesty;

i. professional;

j. integration; and

k. sustainability.

